/T (1. Executive Summary & Architecture Overview This technical document details the engineering design, VLSM subnetting strategy, multilayer switching architecture, routing protocols, and advanced security configurations deployed for the campus network at Cosmos College [cite: 1]. The architecture implements a structured hierarchical topology encompassing Administration, Academic, and Hostel blocks, paired with a protected Server Farm and redundant wide-area network \(WAN\) gateways.)
/E (1. Executive Summary & Architecture Overview This technical document details the engineering design, VLSM subnetting strategy, multilayer switching architecture, routing protocols, and advanced security configurations deployed for the campus network at Cosmos College [cite: 1]. The architecture implements a structured hierarchical topology encompassing Administration, Academic, and Hostel blocks, paired with a protected Server Farm and redundant wide-area network \(WAN\) gateways.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
